    "risk_summary": "Ti3Ge has a still higher source response and is retained as the reverse comparison. Ti3Ni is also retained. Source McMillan, Allen–Dynes and Eli outputs all favor Te versus Sn, and the separate-header proxy is positive at the three declared μ sensitivities.",
